## 已改：`start-desktop-with-shim.ps1` 终端默认保活

改写后的 `_work/desktop-migration/start-desktop-with-shim.ps1` 主流程走 `try/finally`，任何出口都会进保活循环，不再「启动完就关窗」。

核心保活段（文件尾部）：
```powershell
function Invoke-KeepAlive {
    param([int]$IntervalSec, [switch]$Forever)
    Write-Host '--- console held open: Enter / Q / Esc closes it (Ctrl+C also works) ---'
    Write-StatusLine
    $keys = $true
    try { $null = [Console]::KeyAvailable } catch { $keys = $false }
    while ($true) {
        if ($keys) {
            try {
                if ([Console]::KeyAvailable) {
                    $k = [Console]::ReadKey($true)
                    if ($k.Key -eq 'Enter' -or $k.Key -eq 'Q' -or $k.Key -eq 'Escape') { break }
                }
            } catch { $keys = $false }
        }
        if (-not $Forever -and -not $NoLaunch -and (Get-AppCount) -eq 0) { break }
        if ($IntervalSec -gt 0 -and ((Get-Date) -$last).TotalSeconds -ge $IntervalSec) { $last = Get-Date; Write-StatusLine }
        Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 300
    }
}
# ...
if (-not $NoHold) { Invoke-KeepAlive -IntervalSec $HeartbeatSec -Forever:$HoldForever }
```

开关（默认即保活，直接跑就行）：
```powershell
# 默认：保活 + 30s 心跳 + 桌面端退出自动释放窗口
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\start-desktop-with-shim.ps1

# 只测保活、不动桌面端
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\start-desktop-with-shim.ps1 -NoLaunch -HeartbeatSec 3

# 永久按住（不因 App 退出关窗）/ 旧行为 / 改心跳
... -HoldForever        ... -NoHold        ... -HeartbeatSec 10
```
保活用 `[Console]::KeyAvailable` 轮询而非 `Read-Host`，所以 .cmd/.vbs/快捷方式拉起也照样活着；stdin 被重定向时自动降级为纯心跳循环（不抛异常、不退出）。

实测验证（PS 5.1 真跑，非空谈）：
```text
